1
00:00:03,458 --> 00:00:03,833
Wait!

2
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:05,291
Mayura!

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,500
What?

4
00:00:13,875 --> 00:00:17,375
Into the demon's abyss,
the beautiful goddess falls.

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:23,333
She used her own body
to complete the curse song...

6
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:29,083
So you wanted that badly
to sleep beside...

7
00:00:30,208 --> 00:00:33,000
...your brother, Masaki.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,458
Mayura...

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Those three candles you lit
at the temporary shrine...

10
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:44,000
They helped me work out who
the Mountain Child's Messenger was.

11
00:00:45,416 --> 00:00:48,541
But weren't they also a sign
of your kindness?

12
00:00:50,208 --> 00:00:52,750
You prayed for the people
who had been killed.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,833
You couldn't be
a heartless killer.

14
00:00:56,958 --> 00:01:00,458
I believed those prayers
came from your heart.

15
00:01:02,416 --> 00:01:03,708
Mayura...

16
00:01:04,458 --> 00:01:06,208
I wanted you to live.

17
00:01:06,875 --> 00:01:09,500
No matter what
the future held.

18
00:01:11,708 --> 00:01:12,958
Hajime...

19
00:01:18,583 --> 00:01:19,916
Once you're dead...

20
00:01:20,416 --> 00:01:23,250
...everything's over, Mayura!

21
00:01:24,416 --> 00:01:26,791
Was there really nothing
I could do to save you?!
